r  is not safe this is an enormous shift in  the power dynamics of the worlds with  countries all over the planet in uproar  and open rebellion against the  government this is a really big deal it  also strangely enough plays a lot into  the hands of the revolutionaries though  i wonder if that was actually on purpose  or not i'm very curious if it was the  alliance with crocodile and mihawk or  the bounties that ultimately made the  government declare buggy as an emperor  probably both but i still feel like even  more must have happened to really  justify that and so the really big  question now is of course once again is  bucky simply the luckiest man alive that  is the embodiment of fake it till you  make it because oda sensei is doing a  fantastic job selling the idea that  buggy is some sort of one piece eisen  that has kept his true powers and  tensions hidden only to strike when the  time feels right i have discussed this  option in depth in this video on buggy  after it was revealed that he joined the  yonko i think both options are equally  awesome and so it really comes down to  what way oda sensei wants to take this  in is buggy the fraud that we know him  to be that simply failed his way all the  way up to the top a fun character that  just has to play some role in helping  luffy become pirate king probably  against his will who then ended up on  love tale by pure chance or is buggy the  lurking legend someone who was trained  under the former pirate king who other  than shanks has decided to lay low and  bite his time i will say that buggy  looks very much like the real deal in  this poster here so i really can't wait  to find out which of these two truths it  is and even though i've mostly talked  about mihawk here i am so pumped that  crocodile is part of this as well no  matter if crocomom is true or not in  case you don't know that's the theory  that crocodile is actually luffy's mom  you can check out my video about that  one later if you want he is an awesome  character that for some reason decided  to defend luffy at marineford and so i  really can't wait to see these two  reunited once again as well and then of  course we also have to talk about  leaving wano in the end while i still  wish that we could have spent some more  time wrapping everything up and saying  goodbye to all the wonderful characters  that we spent four entire years with i  personally am leaving wano with nothing  but immensely positive emotions really  it genuinely was my favorite arc and  island of one piece so far and i'm  already working on a full analysis of  the entire arc so make sure to subscribe  if you don't want to miss that it's  actually free to subscribe you know  now the thing that i was actually most  excited about this chapter is yamato at  the end standing on top of the palace  ready to join luffy and co i was  actually a bit confused at first why  she's still there and why the straw hats  were getting ready to leave without her  but i guess oda sensei just wanted to  give yamato that classic odin moment of  running towards the sea and finally  leaving wano to become a pirate so  hopefully hopefully fingers crossed uh  we're gonna see her on board of the  thousand sunny in the next chapter god  yamato is awesome i actually do have a  bit of a declaration to make i do think  at this point it's pretty fair to say  that yamato is my favorite character in  one piece dethroning zarro to a close  second i don't know why but i just  really vibe with yamato in so many ways  but this is also the time to say goodbye  to a bunch of other characters at least  for now all the scabbards especially of  course kinemon momonosuke who we already  know will return to play a very  important role later on in the story i  also love that sukiyaki by the way  revealed himself to mom and yori in the  end so they actually do have some true  guidance on how to run the country with  their grandfather plus of course we do  get one last awesome kinemon meme carrot  who i never really saw becoming a straw  hat honestly but who i genuinely loved  as a character nonetheless who has now  been tasked with the ridiculous  responsibility to rule over the entire  mink kingdom which you know seems like a  very strange and cruel decision in a way  the two experienced and elder leaders  chill in wanna with their buddies and  tell the little bunny girl that she's  now responsible for the safety and  survival of her entire race  nothing against you carrot but boy that  might be a little bit above her pay  grade huh they do say that she saw the  outside world but it was really just  wano and whole cake islands but then  again who am i to judge right the  character that i think is maybe the  hardest to see go and that has been  around as long as moment kinemon is of  course law who has been with the crew  since punk hazard and basically the  entire post-time skip saga both law and  kit are of course far from out of the  story much rather oda sensei actually  tries to make it a point here to set  them up as legit rivals to luffy  becoming pirate king but it still feels  like the end to an era if you know what  i mean and i think we all do know that  neither law nor kid in the end will  actually fight luffy for the one piece  but will stand by his side again in the  future i really love that law shared the  poneglyph with kit by the way which was  very unlike him but really shows the  respect that these three captains do  have for each other now kit also tells  us this mysterious story about going  after the man with the burning wound  that seems to be related to the last  poneglyph but isn't quite as nice as law  to share it with the others now i've  been really thinking about this and i  might have forgotten other characters  that do have a burning mark but the only  person that comes to mind really with  this in one piece is actually luffy's  brother sabo so could the  revolutionaries have something to do  with all this given that all three  captains are now officially leaving on  different routes i think it's fair to  assume that we're actually going to a  new island next as well and that of  course for the straw hats hopefully is  going to be elbaf where they might  finally meet shanks and if you want to  know what will happen when these two  finally meet you should really not miss  out on this video right here
 

